    "name": "PLATiNA :: LAB",
    "steam_appid": 3430470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430470/extras/3043101eb7c804e6cddf1b17023512fe.avif?t=1755444268\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>An unpredictable world of data</i><br><i>Rhythm play with squishy, quirky DBs!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2018PLATiNA :: LAB\u2019</strong> is a rhythm game that features a classic top-down note drop play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of tracks across different genres, connect with unique and charming DB(character) units, and discover the distinctive appeal that only <strong>PLATiNA :: LAB</strong> can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Enjoyable gameplay for everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beginners to rhythm game veterans, players can enjoy the game at their own skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two play styles to choose from: <strong>4LINES</strong> and <strong>6LINES</strong>.<br>They may look similar, but each offers a different kind of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, each mode features a <strong>PLUS </strong>Pattern, introducing special pattern twists for deeper gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the rhythm of each track and aim for higher scores by mastering the patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf A music lineup to suit every taste</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From popular songs featured in well-known games and anime,<br>to hit tracks from acclaimed rhythm game artists around the world\u2014<br><strong>PLATiNA :: LAB</strong> also offers a wide range of exclusive original tracks available only in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a rhythm game enthusiast or someone new to the genre,<br>you'll find something to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Gameplay-focused features that maximize rhythm game fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve thoughtfully designed the system from the ground up to enhance the core joy of rhythm gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features like the <strong>Section System</strong>, which shows changes in pattern trends across 5 segments of a song,<br>and the <strong>P.A.T.C.H</strong>, which reflects your accumulated performance and helps track your growth, <br>provide a rich and rewarding play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf A captivating, fully-voiced story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The data world has mysteriously been locked away,<br>and <strong>PLATiNA :: LAB</strong> is in the midst of intense research to restore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join researchers <strong>Airing</strong>, <strong>Bambi</strong>, and <strong>Cake</strong> as you encounter a variety of DB units and uncover the secrets hidden within this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an exciting, fully-voiced story set in a unique universe<br>and immerse yourself in the mystery of the data realm!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430470/extras/3043101eb7c804e6cddf1b17023512fe.avif?t=1755444268\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>An unpredictable world of data</i><br><i>Rhythm play with squishy, quirky DBs!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2018PLATiNA :: LAB\u2019</strong> is a rhythm game that features a classic top-down note drop play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of tracks across different genres, connect with unique and charming DB(character) units, and discover the distinctive appeal that only <strong>PLATiNA :: LAB</strong> can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Enjoyable gameplay for everyone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beginners to rhythm game veterans, players can enjoy the game at their own skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two play styles to choose from: <strong>4LINES</strong> and <strong>6LINES</strong>.<br>They may look similar, but each offers a different kind of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, each mode features a <strong>PLUS </strong>Pattern, introducing special pattern twists for deeper gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the rhythm of each track and aim for higher scores by mastering the patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf A music lineup to suit every taste</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From popular songs featured in well-known games and anime,<br>to hit tracks from acclaimed rhythm game artists around the world\u2014<br><strong>PLATiNA :: LAB</strong> also offers a wide range of exclusive original tracks available only in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a rhythm game enthusiast or someone new to the genre,<br>you'll find something to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Gameplay-focused features that maximize rhythm game fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve thoughtfully designed the system from the ground up to enhance the core joy of rhythm gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features like the <strong>Section System</strong>, which shows changes in pattern trends across 5 segments of a song,<br>and the <strong>P.A.T.C.H</strong>, which reflects your accumulated performance and helps track your growth, <br>provide a rich and rewarding play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf A captivating, fully-voiced story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The data world has mysteriously been locked away,<br>and <strong>PLATiNA :: LAB</strong> is in the midst of intense research to restore it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join researchers <strong>Airing</strong>, <strong>Bambi</strong>, and <strong>Cake</strong> as you encounter a variety of DB units and uncover the secrets hidden within this strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an exciting, fully-voiced story set in a unique universe<br>and immerse yourself in the mystery of the data realm!</p>",
    "short_description": "A new rhythm game featuring innovative characters inspired by databases! Join the research of PLATiNA :: LAB to uncover the secrets of the locked data world as a special 'Decoder' with unique abilities.",
